{"run_id": "run_b48bcd2b2324", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s02_not_aware", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我们近期在课程发布页面新增了“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原发布流程不变，您可以根据课程场景选择。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "之前我们用的直播是什么？我好像没注意过这些选项。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "之前后台统一配置的是低延迟链路，所以您可能没看到选项。现在您可以自己选择了。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那标准直播和低延迟直播有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播成本会高一些。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "明白了。那发布流程会变吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "发布流程不变，只是在页面多两个选项。您是通过Web控制台、校验系统还是SaaS系统发布课程？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "我们用的是Web控制台。但我现在没看到低延迟直播的选项。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "可能是后台配置尚未完成，您稍后刷新一下页面，或者联系平台确认权限。后续我们也会通过企业微信发送通知，请您关注同步提示。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我回头看看。还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "暂时没有了。感谢您的接听，祝您工作顺利！"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "谢谢，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "informed", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
