{"run_id": "run_b48bcd2b2324", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_006", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s06_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？我正在上课，请简短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，长话短说。直播发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原流程不变。低延迟直播延迟1-2秒，适合互动课；标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本较低。您之前用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道了。我现在没时间细看，能不能晚点再联系？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "没问题，我稍后通过企业微信发送通知，您关注一下。或者我预约一个回访时间，方便吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "好，下午3点后吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我记录下午3点回访。您先忙，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 6, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "preferred_time": "2025-03-21 15:00"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
